@using AFMA.ApplicationLayer.Helpers
@using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Mvc.TagHelpers
@model IEnumerable<AFMA.ApplicationLayer.ViewModels.SubmissionStatsViewModel>

@{
  var filterMonth = Context.Request.Query["filterMonth"].ToNullableInt();
  var filterYear = Context.Request.Query["filterYear"].ToNullableInt();
}

<nav aria-label="breadcrumb" id="main-breadcrumb">
  <ol class="breadcrumb">
    <li class="breadcrumb-item"><a href="#">Home</a></li>
    <li class="breadcrumb-item"><a href="#">Mycotoxins</a></li>
    <li class="breadcrumb-item active" aria-current="page">Submissions</li>
  </ol>
</nav>

<div class="card">
  <div class="card-body">
    <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center">
      <h4>Mycotoxin Submissions</h4>
    </div>

    <div class="alert alert-dark">
      <form asp-action="Submissions" method="get">

        <div class="row g-2">
          <div class="col-1">
            <div class="form-group">
              <label class="form-label">Year</label>
              <select id="filterYear" name="filterYear" class="form-control" asp-items="@GeneralHelpers.GenerateYearSelectList(filterYear)"></select>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-2">
            <div class="form-group">
              <label class="form-label">Month</label>
              <select id="filterMonth" name="filterMonth" class="form-control" asp-items="@GeneralHelpers.GenerateMonthSelectList(filterMonth)"></select>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="col-2">
            <div class="form-group">
              <label class="form-label">&nbsp;</label><br />
              <button type="submit" class="btn btn-afm-secondary"><i class="fa-solid fa-refresh"></i> Refresh</button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </form>
    </div>
    
    <div class="alert alert-info">
      <p>Report status explanation</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>REPORT NOT FOUND</strong> - This member is an active mycotoxin member, but not reports were found for the specified period. If this is a new member, please populate the relevant reports from System Admin.</li>
        <li><strong>OUTSTANDING</strong> - The report for this member for the specific period is outstanding.</li>
        <li><strong>SUBMITTED</strong> - The report for this member for the specific period has been submitted.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="table-responsive">
      <table class="table table-striped table-bordered">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th scope="col" class="w-15">Member</th>
            <th scope="col" class="w-15">Branch</th>
            <th scope="col" class="w-15">Info For</th>
            <th scope="col" class="w-10">Due Date</th>
            <th scope="col" class="w-5">Report</th>
            <th scope="col" class="w-10 text-center">Status</th>
            <th scope="col" class="text-center">Comment</th>
            <th class="w-10"></th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          @foreach (var item in Model)
          {
            <tr>
              <td class="align-middle">
                @item.MemberName
              </td>
              <td class="align-middle">
                @item.BranchName
              </td>
              <td class="align-middle">
                @item.InfoFor
              </td>
              <td class="align-middle">
                @item.DueDate?.ToString("dd/MM/yyyy")
              </td>
              <td class="align-middle">
                <a asp-area="" asp-controller="MycotoxinReport" asp-action="Details" asp-route-id="@item.ReportId">@item.ReportId</a>
              </td>
              <td class="align-middle text-center">
                @Html.Raw(item.Status)
              </td>
              <td>
                @item.Comment
              </td>
              <td class="text-center">
                @if (!item.Submitted && !string.IsNullOrEmpty(item.InfoFor))
                {
                  <a asp-area="" asp-controller="MycotoxinReport" asp-action="SendReminder" asp-route-id="@item.ReportId" class="btn btn-afm-primary btn-sm"><i class="fa-regular fa-paper-plane"></i> Send Reminder</a>
                }
              </td>
            </tr>
          }
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>